    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9006" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνίδρ-ωτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without having sweated</i>
			or <i>exercised oneself,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γενόμενοι εἰσίοιεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					2.1.29
				</span></i>
			: <i>not accompanied by perspirations,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴκτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Judic.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
